                        ],
                        "form": "waddled"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0fee17f5-0ebd-3e67-bfa1-2d336bb95387",
                        "entry_id": "0af4cda9-b2fd-3125-befb-cd16b66d20c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To walk with short steps, tilting the body from side to side."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0915256-1b0e-40e6-98ca-745a016124c4",
                                "sense_id": "0fee17f5-0ebd-3e67-bfa1-2d336bb95387",
                                "text": "The pond was another favourite place to visit. Moorhens strutted from the neighbouring bushes, and a bevy of Muscovy ducks, a study in black, white and red, waddled from the farmyard hard by to enjoy a refreshing splash."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6f21119b-95b2-3a98-9875-93c381c418de",
                        "entry_id": "0af4cda9-b2fd-3125-befb-cd16b66d20c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To move slowly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "71a860d5-2252-443a-943f-f045e62bd120",
                                "sense_id": "6f21119b-95b2-3a98-9875-93c381c418de",
                                "text": "Now, on the bright side, things weren't all bad; they had commendably-thick belt armor, which was 12 inches thickness, and they had a very large number of subdivided watertight compartments, which would make them very durable. Due to their being quite fat, they could also turn very quickly, even if they were waddling along by the end of the turn."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d31918a-87a0-4c46-9350-b116eb5c188d",
                        "source_entry_id": "0af4cda9-b2fd-3125-befb-cd16b66d20c2",
                        "source_sense_description": "to walk with short steps, tilting the body from side to side",
                        "target_lang_word": "kolébat se",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b2f146c8-c85b-422c-bd66-696515dff81a",
                        "source_entry_id": "0af4cda9-b2fd-3125-befb-cd16b66d20c2",
                        "source_sense_description": "to walk with short steps, tilting the body from side to side",
                        "target_lang_word": "waggelen",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "waggelen",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89fc0e51-ba79-3404-a0c8-21f368fdf495",
                                        "entry_id": "2d5bc149-741f-3e13-a35c-48edc85de829",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zich zijdeling slingerend voortbewegen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "unergative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a227c7ec-5097-441f-8482-a07429f90bfc",
                                                "sense_id": "89fc0e51-ba79-3404-a0c8-21f368fdf495",
                                                "text": "Er werd gewaggeld en gesloft, maar de dronken mannen zetten zich toch in beweging."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0001024f-2d00-3ecb-8f77-4f5badc43267",
                                        "entry_id": "2d5bc149-741f-3e13-a35c-48edc85de829",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zijdelings slingerend zich ergens heen begeven"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ergative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3da8570-a888-41c3-b609-6a4b03fc70e8",
                                                "sense_id": "0001024f-2d00-3ecb-8f77-4f5badc43267",
                                                "text": "De dronken man was naar de overkant van de weg gewaggeld."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "93e2b2ac-085a-4455-88e4-fcab2ab17e6d",
                        "source_entry_id": "0af4cda9-b2fd-3125-befb-cd16b66d20c2",
                        "source_sense_description": "to walk with short steps, tilting the body from side to side",
                        "target_lang_word": "se dandiner",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "se dandiner",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d2ac3259-2b27-38c1-8384-109f0f7194d8",
                                        "entry_id": "6cea855f-439a-3a5c-a3e9-67f8edcb0782",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Balancer son corps soit par nonchalance, soit par manque de contenance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16e522a6-1ad4-4a12-affe-d115670e65e2",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ac3259-2b27-38c1-8384-109f0f7194d8",
                                                "text": "En vain je parcourais les promenades d'un petit air vainqueur; je me dandinais, je frappais l'air de ma badine d'ébène, j'arrangeais mes cheveux, je dérangeais ma cravate; en un mot, je me donnais des grâces: rien n'y faisait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8f55778-932e-467c-b7c7-a4f47cae1db6",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ac3259-2b27-38c1-8384-109f0f7194d8",
                                                "text": "Elle vient se dandiner solennellement autour du plateau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "892c04a6-33dd-4d68-9f06-6989e6f7a885",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ac3259-2b27-38c1-8384-109f0f7194d8",
                                                "text": "A l'en croire, c'était lui qui dansait, qui levait la jambe, qui se dandinait, tellement il se donnait de mal pour communiquer à ces merveilleuses mais stupides créatures un peu du feu sacré dont il les prétendait dépourvues."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd0887da-85c5-4494-8266-6604b56ae68b",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ac3259-2b27-38c1-8384-109f0f7194d8",
                                                "text": "Il traverse la pièce en se dandinant comme une frégate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "294c7e44-4268-4eec-b4b7-6ee5733e9ec2",
                        "source_entry_id": "0af4cda9-b2fd-3125-befb-cd16b66d20c2",
